lo:F0048T-1 a et:LearningOutcome ;
    rdfs:label "The overall aim of the course is to give students a fundamental unterstanding of waveoptics, photonic components and skills to construct and analyze optical systems. After passing the course students should have fundamental knowledge on: Knowledge and comprehension; Propagation of light in different media"@en .

lo:F0048T-2 a et:LearningOutcome ;
